flowchart LR
  A[Workload requirements] --> C[Actual VM suitability validation]
  B[Infrastructure-supplied VM snapshot] --> C
  C --> D{Resource checks}
  D -->|fail| E[Incompatible]
  D -->|pass, performance absent| F[Provisionally compatible]
  D -->|pass, performance measured| G[Compatible]
  F --> H[Capability-based agent handoff plan]
  G --> H
  H --> I[Execution status: not executed]
